/Title (Currently, there are 641 FYI vouchers allocated to Texas, but only 75% are currently in use. Accounting for the vouchers that are already utilized, an estimated 1,859 aged-out youth in Texas are eligible for an FYI voucher. Ensuring that aged-out youth experiencing homelessness or housing instability have access to supportive services until their 25th birthday would allow all eligible youth to access available FYI vouchers.)
