/Title (The Texas Legislature should consider a budget request that includes $9,712,500 in 2027-28 to support services for 925 youth, followed by $16.65 million in 2028-29 to scale services to an additional 925 youth, to cover the supportive service requirement for the FYI program. This would serve 1,850 youth \(the midpoint of the range for the estimated unmet need\), enabling eligible youth to successfully access these vouchers and receive the resources necessary to achieve housing stability and self-sufficiency.)
